Package: vabaxos-orca-sounds
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, orca
Description: Sounds of the screen reader: a sound instead of "button"
 A short sound instead of the names of buttons, links, check boxes,
 combo boxes, text fields, menus, tabs and other controls, for shorter
 readings. It works through an Orca user extension (Orca 51 and later),
 installed and approved only when the user turns the sounds on; a window
 plays every sound with its name, to learn them first. If a name is not
 recognized, Orca says it as always.
